# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Ruční nasazení modelů Qiskit Code Assistantu lokálně "
"přes Ollama\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Existuje několik způsobů, jak nasadit a pracovat se staženým modelem Qiskit "
"Code Assistantu. Tato příručka demonstruje použití "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) takto: buď pomocí [aplikace Ollama](#using-the-"
"ollama-application) s využitím integrace Hugging Face Hub nebo lokálního "
"modelu, nebo pomocí [balíčku `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-cpp-python).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Použití aplikace Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aplikace Ollama poskytuje jednoduché řešení pro lokální spouštění LLM. Je "
"snadná na použití, s CLI, které celý proces nastavení, správu modelů a "
"interakci s nimi činí poměrně přímočarými. Je ideální pro rychlé "
"experimentování a pro uživatele, kteří chtějí mít méně technických detailů "
"na starosti.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Instalace Ollamy {#install-ollama}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Stáhni [aplikaci Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Nainstaluj stažený soubor\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Spusť nainstalovanou aplikaci Ollama\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        Aplikace běží úspěšně, když se ikona Ollamy zobrazí v pruhu nabídek plochy. Funkčnost služby můžeš také ověřit přechodem na `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr "Vyzkoušej Ollamu v terminálu a začni spouštět modely. Například:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"Nastavení Ollamy pomocí integrace Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Integrace Ollama/Hugging Face Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) "
"poskytuje způsob, jak pracovat s modely hostovanými na Hugging Face Hub, "
"aniž by bylo nutné vytvářet nový modelfile nebo ručně stahovat soubory GGUF "
"či safetensors. Výchozí soubory `template` a `params` jsou pro model na "
"Hugging Face Hub již zahrnuty.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Ujisti se, že aplikace Ollama běží.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přejdi na stránku požadovaného modelu a zkopíruj URL. Například "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "V terminálu spusť příkaz:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Můžeš použít model `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` nebo kterýkoli z "
"dalších aktuálně doporučených oficiálních modelů GGUF `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` nebo `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"Nastavení Ollamy s ručně staženým modelem GGUF Qiskit Code Assistantu {#set-"
"up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud jsi ručně stáhl model GGUF, například "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF, a chceš "
"experimentovat s různými šablonami a parametry, můžeš jej načíst do lokální "
"aplikace Ollama podle těchto kroků.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vytvoř soubor `Modelfile` s následujícím obsahem a nezapomeň aktualizovat "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` na skutečnou cestu ke staženému modelu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
